sonic (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of the Rust pmon daemons
  * Each reaches the platform through the generated facade in
    sonic-platform-common rather than through a vendor-specific crate
  * One binary package per daemon, from one workspace build, each switchable
    back to its Python counterpart from pmon_daemon_control.json

 -- SONiC Team <sonic-dev@lists.sonicfoundation.dev>  Wed, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 -0800
